ac3forge provides CMake targets via find_package(ac3forge):

    find_package(ac3forge CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ac3::forge)

The Matroska (.mkv) container writer is a separate, opt-in feature ("matroska", installed by
default) - when present, matroska::matroska is also available:

    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE matroska::matroska)

To install ac3forge without it:

    vcpkg install ac3forge[core]
